Design a circuit that converts a 4-bit binary input into a 3-bit unary output. The module takes a 4-bit input, computes its decimal equivalent, and maps specific decimal values (0 through 5) to a corresponding 3-bit output. For any input value greater than 5, the output defaults to a maximum value of 3'b111.
